WEBVTT

00:02:23.915 --> 00:02:30.915
(Music)

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.049
Last year, the World Health Organization

00:02:34.073 --> 00:02:37.266
declared burnout an occupational syndrome.

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:39.746
According to some estimates,
in the US alone,

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:42.606
burned out employees cost
over 100 billion dollars a year

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:44.366
in healthcare spending.

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:48.026
More than a third of employees report
feeling burned out some of the time.

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:51.623
Nearly a quarter feel that way
very often or always.

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:55.706
The core of burnout
is emotional exhaustion,

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.556
feeling so depleted and drained

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:00.893
that you just don't have
anything left to give your job.